      "index": "a1",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Five recommended flows, one per stage of the Institutions & Teams journey (one row each, top to bottom).\nBlack and gray: the interface. Blue: navigation between screens; pills link one flow to the next. Yellow: UX notes.",
